{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "88f60de7df22b3e7cd5eea0fb11ccfb235bc6fb9b1165c6aae3c85029098720d", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌、『アイグラ！！』での育のテーマは\nウェイトレスだ。……そろそろ着替え終わったかな？）", "zh": "（育在写真杂志《偶像写真！！》中的主题是女服务生。……差不多该换好衣服了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1001_se", "source_sha256": "83ee68489596bd1e101b1ae0e007c9a3b092e5d5bbc2c2d47a390e847fe280bc", "ja": "カランカラン！", "zh": "叮叮当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "ac7cf1dba6da67fefca6a4cc9763fdd840b4a89d6ed71515537a94125c175b59", "ja": "いらっしゃいませ～。\nおひとりさまでよろしいですか？", "zh": "欢迎光临～\n请问是一位吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1003_p", "source_sha256": "316f21cef2567cd572a5a45d8c3e0995406e8f428c110726f58056559550e719", "ja": "あっ、はい、ひとりで……って、あれ？　育か。\n本物のウェイトレスかと思ったよ。", "zh": "啊，好的，我一个人……咦？原来是育啊。\n我还以为是真正的女服务员呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "2f4ff5491fdc227caac403c962c05347192b987e34aca3856e278cc9b70101bf", "ja": "えへへ、本当？\nわたしのウェイトレス、そんなに上手だった？", "zh": "嘿嘿，真的吗？\n我的女服务生扮相，有那么像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b91b898ba9c5476a665093b425d121aad7e382b9cf61d8d8fba8dbebfdcaf018", "ja": "かなりリアルだと思うよ。\nしっかり練習してきてくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "我觉得已经相当逼真了。\n看来你确实认真练习过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "2f8314f8a757aa53d8a2a40639895396f2f4efb139606b1cd315d5c21bc61e88", "ja": "うん、すっごく練習したよ。おかあさんに、\n本当に喫茶店に連れて行ってもらったりしたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，我可是练习了好多哦。妈妈还真的带我去了咖啡店呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "b5d401096be63bf1d396c667b449de6e43fb3d44201832259caf53c99a1c3afd", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、\nそのままお客さんの役をしてもらっていい？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，可以请你直接扮演客人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "d741123951cac99ff38db33eb4e548e4464f1bd11a4a288c2666bbfd1e1c151a", "ja": "わたし、本番が始まる前にもう少し練習したい！", "zh": "我想在正式演出开始前再多练习一会儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c652b4323dbd67700c5503c018326e06bea054f305cfc61e4d30b60cf795fde2", "ja": "ああ、もちろんいいよ。", "zh": "好啊，当然没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "10504a7ec3e377a044318c3e2b95fbd9da3074db8896529c019eb083dcd1b7e6", "ja": "うん！　ありがとう、{$P$}さん！\nじゃあ……お客さま、ご注文はお決まりですか？", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，{$P$}先生！\n那么……客人，您决定好要点什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1011_p", "source_sha256": "84828cb0c9896b5014b0c27c2f388ff5f05399bd228ebb72e4075482e35c6018", "ja": "ああ、えっと、実はまだ決めてなくて……。", "zh": "啊，那个，其实还没决定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "f1a78e5ef6c21f2927bf5f29adcd7459559120be9df7efc0a59d50d41cfcf361", "ja": "今日のおすすめはオムライスです！\nケチャップで似顔絵も描けますよ。", "zh": "今天推荐的是蛋包饭！\n还可以用番茄酱画肖像画哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1013_p", "source_sha256": "06e5096259592204736e32dea6183d56aabec9158d6b477f107482fec4af7c2a", "ja": "おっ、じゃあそれひとつ！\n……今日のオススメまであるなんて、本格的だな。", "zh": "哦，那就来一份！  \n……连今天的推荐菜都有，还挺专业的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "82f6f965e58efa29e0dfa1b0518fcbf4f928ba134e195c24398057563dc7b9ce", "ja": "えへへ♪　{$P$}さんは\nいそがしいからお昼の時間もあんまり取れないでしょ？", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　{$P$}先生很忙，所以午饭时间也没多少吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "53c4806e999cf6361f7084f409650af5d4c47eed64212b37217b7950620529af", "ja": "だから早く決めて、その分ゆっくり\nご飯を食べてもらったほうがいいなと思って！", "zh": "所以我觉得，还是快点决定下来，好让您能多花点时间慢慢吃饭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1016_p", "source_sha256": "b883f8c604c1d3a28c692450d43597f18114b59e4d5ff747b0eb36a4742a3dce", "ja": "うん。しっかりイメージできてるみたいだし、\n今日の撮影は期待できそうだな。", "zh": "嗯。看起来脑海里已经很有画面感了，\n今天的拍摄值得期待啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "e6945ebbbee5c6f05fb119fa5699d2765c4246c70843a74d2b70554d6d59c4f6", "ja": "ううん、まだまだだよ！　笑顔でお客さんを\nお見送りするまでが、ウェイトレスのお仕事だもん。", "zh": "才没有呢，还差得远呢！能面带微笑\n送走客人，才算服务员的工作呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1018_030iku", "source_sha256": "22e23105300ad0e82f61be375ae3bae9d3099da9dd56a889eaa4489498c24d8c", "ja": "注文をとおしたり、空いたお皿を片付けたり……。\nちゃんと全部できるようにならなきゃ！", "zh": "帮客人点单、收拾空盘子……  \n我得努力做到样样都做好才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c5b42308abaa86a0a96dc5bfc75d1590a009c319cc306abddfd22b5977cca595", "ja": "育は本当に真面目だな……えらいよ。\nよし、俺にも何か、手伝えることはあるか？", "zh": "育真的很认真啊……真了不起。好，我这边有没有什么能帮忙的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "e03585782110fc4805baf8490187b611572fcec0d2e239a4f5a89fae987c57f4", "ja": "ありがとう！　じゃあ{$P$}さんは、\nコックさんとお客さんと店長さんの役をやってね！", "zh": "谢谢！那{$P$}先生就来演\n厨师、客人还有店长的角色吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b5b73b83a260ccde7bdf6b1f6236c55e4e8fdef17bfed7bd799909699ed74d6f", "ja": "えっ、それ全部俺なのか？\nわ、わかった、できる限り頑張るよ！", "zh": "咦，那些角色全都要我来演吗？\n好、好吧，我会尽最大努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0213_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "db95713f66e3b5e4257811d1ebcfbdac059a70eb6de750a9bbf254eabcff744b", "ja": "それじゃあ、注文はいりまーす！\nオムライスひとつ、愛情たっぷりで、お願いしまーす！", "zh": "那么，我来下单啦！\n请来一份蛋包饭，要满满的爱心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
